  "claim_boundary": "For one explicitly specified cyclic 64-to-36 SDR, this working draft proves that the retained mixed gravity-Maxwell ell3 representative is nonzero by two exact zero-derivative witnesses, that every mixed exchange channel contributing to the declared ell3 vanishes by projection support on the contractible Theta_star row, and that the exact sparse implementation realizes the formal cyclic homotopy-transfer identities. The convention-specific cyclic adjoint matrix identities are displayed, and all 106 exact inclusion-column coefficients for the dressed gravity coordinates used by the witnesses and their pairing are printed in a generated appendix. The separately certified LORENTZIAN-CAUSAL unary Green and K_Berger Cartan theorem is connected by explicit full-to-retained formulas but is not the propagator used in the algebraic ell3 transfer. The LOCAL-ALGEBRAIC physical-action deformation filtration is now exact through total jet order one. At constant field the cyclic cotangent-lift coboundary map on the complete 550-dimensional mixed quartic sector has rank 550 and zero cokernel, and a 51-coefficient F3 primitive reconstructs all 63 nonzero target coordinates. At first positive jet order the exact IBP quotient has dimension 1,330 per derivative axis; its positive-jet block has rank 1,327 and cokernel dimension three, while the coupled constant-kernel Schur system has rank 557 and its target is compatible. The coupled solution uses 51 zero-jet coefficients and positive-jet primitives with 43, 94, 95 and 108 nonzero coefficients to reconstruct the four derivative-axis targets. Thus the displayed evaluations witness representative nonvanishing but do not witness deformation-class nontriviality even through this physical-action truncation. The 288 ghost/antifield completion coefficients and total jet order two and above remain open. A separate LOCAL-ALGEBRAIC certificate obstructs the declared canonical same-bundle Einstein-like/extra-Weyl projector on rank 36. Its natural rank-46 spatial-STF2 graph prolongation and cyclic dual are exact, with exported cyclic shear and a scoped 225-coefficient solver contract. The principal wave module is a nonsplit dual-number extension, and the physical polarization input is independently derived as a rank-two transverse-traceless projective module inside the full six-dimensional Berger null-symbol cohomology, with nondegenerate cyclic pairing; tensoring with the repeated-wave algebra gives a rank-four generalized-wave module. The exact filtered V2 descent equation is now decided: the plus polarization has a normalized obstruction evaluation one for every allowed gauge and boundary correction, while the cross polarization lifts with coefficient 71/40. Consequently the requested support-local branch projector with this principal anchor is obstructed on the contractible rank-46 graph carrier. This is not a global no-go for every carrier; an unsplit observable, noncontractible or mixed-bundle enlargement, or explicitly REDUCED-MODE nonlocal split remains open. No nonlinear lift on an accepted branch carrier, K_Berger-compatible branch projector, causal branch support, or mixing table is available. The paper does not prove nonvanishing on ell1 cohomology, a nontrivial full cyclic deformation class, invariance under changing SDR, nonremovability in the full BV or higher-jet complex, survival under further minimal transfer, residual Einstein-like/extra-Weyl/Maxwell mixing, a particle amplitude, QME restoration, or any quantum theorem. It remains WRITING_STARTED rather than THEOREM_FROZEN."
